      "definition": "Lecture expression for effective mean-field dynamics.",
      "key_rule": "HMF ≈ −2JψΣⱼ(bⱼ+bⱼ†) + 2Jψ²N + (U/2)Σⱼnⱼ(nⱼ−1) − μΣⱼnⱼ",
